# @name: aws | Copy File from S3
# @description: Copies a file from S3 to local Group: AWS S3 Commands. Template: replace placeholders before running. {bucket_name} = Name of the S3 bucket | {s3_key} = S3 object key | {local_file} = Path to local file
aws s3 cp s3://{bucket_name}/{s3_key} {local_file}